    <string name="set_download_title">Model download</string>
    <string name="set_download_desc">Qwen-Image-2.1 MNN · int4 · ~10.6 GB download, ~11 GB installed. Includes text-to-image, photo-editing and RGBA-sticker components.\n\nThis is currently the smallest official variant — the 7B DiT int4 (4.3 GB) and the Qwen3-VL-8B text encoder int4 (4.9 GB) dominate the size, and no lighter quantization exists. A text-to-image-only bundle would save only ~0.5 GB.</string>
